# Day 16 – Marketing & Copywriting Prompts

## What is a Marketing & Copywriting Prompt?

Marketing & Copywriting Prompts are prompts that help create content to promote a product, service, or business.

## Why is it useful?

 Because Businesses hire AI freelancers to create:

Social media posts
Product descriptions
Email campaigns
Blog articles
Ad copy
Website content
Video scripts etc.
#mistake - Marketing & Copywriting Prompts are useful because they help create professional marketing content quickly, save time, and help businesses attract more customers.

## Name 5 Marketing Tasks

- Social Media Posts
- Product Descriptions
- Email Campaigns
- Blog Articles
- Advertisements

